# Line endings are a correctness concern in this repository, not a style preference.
#
# The frozen corpus is content-addressed: `dataset_hash` is a SHA-256 over the exact
# bytes of every artefact. The freeze code writes LF explicitly so a corpus frozen on
# Windows hashes identically to one frozen on POSIX. Git undoing that on checkout would
# mean a fresh clone fails its own integrity check, and the determinism guarantee would
# silently hold only on the machine that produced it.

# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository and in working copies.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The frozen corpus is never converted, in either direction. Stored and checked out
# byte-for-byte as committed.
data/frozen/** -text

# Binary artefacts.
*.png binary
